  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "被低估的民国大女主徐广平，她从来不是鲁迅的配角，而是活出自我的大女主。说起徐广平，绝大多数人的第一印象都是鲁迅夫人，可如果只把她当成文豪身边的配角，那你真的太小看这位民国奇女子了。她的人生从一开始就拿着逆天改命的剧本，硬生生从封建礼教的牢笼里，活成了自己人生的大女主。一千八百九十八年，许广平出生在广州番禺高地街的许家大院。这可不是普通人家许家从盐商发家世代官宦，祖上出过抗英领袖、浙江巡抚堂兄许重志，更是后来的越军总司令，是当地数一数二的名门望族。按说，生在这样的世家，他本该顺着旧时代的规矩，长大裹小脚，学女红，深居简出，等着家人安排婚事，安稳度过一生。可徐广平从懂事起，骨子里就刻着不服输的劲儿。他的命运枷锁来的比所有人都早出生刚三天。父亲徐炳飞在酒宴上与友人碰杯为婚，随口就将尚在襁褓中的他许配给了香港一户马姓人家马甲，对外标榜读书首领，实则纵容子弟，横行乡里、拦路勒索，是远近闻名的劣身之家。等父亲反应过来，悔不当初时，聘礼一收，婚约已定，碍于脸面和世俗规矩根本无法反悔。这么荒唐的娃娃亲，就这样成了套在徐广平身上的第一道枷锁。十五岁那年，马家派人来商议婚妻徐广平直接站出来当面表态，明确拒绝这门婚事气的马家人，骂他是世家败类，可他半点不退让。等他渐渐长大，更是想的通透，哭和闹都换不来自由女人。只有自己能立足，能独立，才能真正掌握人生的主动权。八岁那年，家里按旧俗，要给他裹小脚，这是当时几乎所有女孩都逃不开的宿命。可徐广平拼死反抗，哭闹着，死活不肯缠足。幸好父亲思想相对开明，最终松了口。他才保住了一双自由的脚。后来他常说，自己这双脚是从旧礼教手里硬生生抢回来的。在读书这件事上，他更是逆着规矩来。清末的广东依旧信奉女子无才便是德。女孩家能识几个字，写封家书就足够了，可徐广平偏要和家中兄弟一起进私塾、读书、学官画读典籍，还偷偷找新式书报来看，早早接触到了民主与解放的新思想。在守旧沉闷的大家族里，他的一举一动都算得上离京。叛到一九一七年，父亲病逝，马家没了顾忌，立刻上门步步紧逼，催婚。失去父亲庇护的徐广平，没有半分退缩，他在二哥的帮助下据理力争，最终彻底解除了这桩束缚。他近二十年的包办婚约，挣脱了婚姻的枷锁。他做了一个震惊，全家的决定，离开广东北上求学，去看更广阔的世界。他先是考入天津直隶第一女子师范学校苦读。多年后，又顺利考入北京女子高等师范学校。五四运动爆发时，他已经是学生运动的骨干领袖。上节演讲、创办刊物，还担任了刑事周刊的主编，提笔写文章，呼吁妇女解放思想自由。他从来不是躲在后面喊口号的人，每次学生运动都冲在最前面。一九二五年，北京女高师爆发轰动一时的屈阳风潮，校长杨殷于智孝装，横肆意压制学生思想激起的全校学生的反抗。身为学生会总干事的徐广平和后来在三幺八惨案中牺牲的刘和珍一起，带领同学们罢课请愿、发檄文和校方强硬对抗，哪怕最终被学校开除，他也始终挺直腰杆。没有半分低头。也正是在这段风波里，他提笔给鲁迅写了第一封信，开启了两人的缘分。很多人觉得徐广平是崇拜鲁迅，疑附鲁迅的小女生，可回头看他走过的路，就会明白，在遇见鲁迅之前，他早就已经是一个有思想、有胆识、敢和整个旧世界对抗的独立女性了。她有自己的理想和战场，有不输给任何人的勇气和棱角。他敢于爱上鲁迅，敢于冲破世俗偏见。和他走到一起，从来不是仰望式的义附，而是两个独立灵魂的惺惺相惜。从被定下娃娃亲的世家小姐，到投身时代浪潮的新女性，从挣脱封建礼教的叛逆者，到守护鲁迅精神的践行者，徐广平的一生，从来都在为自己而活，他不依附谁的光环，不被谁的标签定义。他就是他自己是敢和命运叫板，敢为自己掌舵的徐广平。好了，今天的故事就到这里。你印象里的徐广平是什么样的？欢迎在评论区留言，聊聊你的看法。如果喜欢这样的传奇女性故事，别忘了点赞关注，下期继续带你解锁更多被历史低估的独立人生。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 70,
      "end_ms": 2790,
      "text": "被低估的民国大女主徐广平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3390,
      "end_ms": 5370,
      "text": "她从来不是鲁迅的配角，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5390,
      "end_ms": 7390,
      "text": "而是活出自我的大女主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8109,
      "end_ms": 9130,
      "text": "说起徐广平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9610,
      "end_ms": 12970,
      "text": "绝大多数人的第一印象都是鲁迅夫人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13550,
      "end_ms": 16850,
      "text": "可如果只把她当成文豪身边的配角，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17370,
      "end_ms": 21530,
      "text": "那你真的太小看这位民国奇女子了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22170,
      "end_ms": 26190,
      "text": "她的人生从一开始就拿着逆天改命的剧本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26670,
      "end_ms": 29815,
      "text": "硬生生从封建礼教的牢笼里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 30250,
      "end_ms": 32450,
      "text": "活成了自己人生的大女主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 33070,
      "end_ms": 34790,
      "text": "一千八百九十八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35170,
      "end_ms": 40250,
      "text": "许广平出生在广州番禺高地街的许家大院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40370,
      "end_ms": 45470,
      "text": "这可不是普通人家许家从盐商发家世代官宦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 46070,
      "end_ms": 51230,
      "text": "祖上出过抗英领袖、浙江巡抚堂兄许重志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 51530,
      "end_ms": 53610,
      "text": "更是后来的越军总司令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 53850,
      "end_ms": 56970,
      "text": "是当地数一数二的名门望族。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 57630,
      "end_ms": 58010,
      "text": "按说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 58010,
      "end_ms": 59190,
      "text": "生在这样的世家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 59490,
      "end_ms": 61640,
      "text": "他本该顺着旧时代的规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 61640,
      "end_ms": 63310,
      "text": "长大裹小脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 63470,
      "end_ms": 64285,
      "text": "学女红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64700,
      "end_ms": 65835,
      "text": "深居简出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 66390,
      "end_ms": 68275,
      "text": "等着家人安排婚事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 68640,
      "end_ms": 69825,
      "text": "安稳度过一生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 70660,
      "end_ms": 72445,
      "text": "可徐广平从懂事起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 73080,
      "end_ms": 75175,
      "text": "骨子里就刻着不服输的劲儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 76150,
      "end_ms": 81025,
      "text": "他的命运枷锁来的比所有人都早出生刚三天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 81450,
      "end_ms": 86065,
      "text": "父亲徐炳飞在酒宴上与友人碰杯为婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 86590,
      "end_ms": 93500,
      "text": "随口就将尚在襁褓中的他许配给了香港一户马姓人家马甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 93520,
      "end_ms": 95745,
      "text": "对外标榜读书首领，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 96170,
      "end_ms": 97970,
      "text": "实则纵容子弟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 98070,
      "end_ms": 100425,
      "text": "横行乡里、拦路勒索，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 100710,
      "end_ms": 103245,
      "text": "是远近闻名的劣身之家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 104090,
      "end_ms": 105490,
      "text": "等父亲反应过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 105490,
      "end_ms": 106595,
      "text": "悔不当初时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 107080,
      "end_ms": 108195,
      "text": "聘礼一收，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 108710,
      "end_ms": 109625,
      "text": "婚约已定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 109970,
      "end_ms": 113595,
      "text": "碍于脸面和世俗规矩根本无法反悔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 114140,
      "end_ms": 115745,
      "text": "这么荒唐的娃娃亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 116100,
      "end_ms": 120455,
      "text": "就这样成了套在徐广平身上的第一道枷锁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 120710,
      "end_ms": 121645,
      "text": "十五岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 122050,
      "end_ms": 126865,
      "text": "马家派人来商议婚妻徐广平直接站出来当面表态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 127280,
      "end_ms": 130400,
      "text": "明确拒绝这门婚事气的马家人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 130400,
      "end_ms": 132015,
      "text": "骂他是世家败类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 132480,
      "end_ms": 133935,
      "text": "可他半点不退让。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 134560,
      "end_ms": 135895,
      "text": "等他渐渐长大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 136300,
      "end_ms": 137875,
      "text": "更是想的通透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 138250,
      "end_ms": 141450,
      "text": "哭和闹都换不来自由女人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 141470,
      "end_ms": 142945,
      "text": "只有自己能立足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 143250,
      "end_ms": 143935,
      "text": "能独立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 144350,
      "end_ms": 147115,
      "text": "才能真正掌握人生的主动权。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 148770,
      "end_ms": 149615,
      "text": "八岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 150100,
      "end_ms": 151280,
      "text": "家里按旧俗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 151380,
      "end_ms": 152555,
      "text": "要给他裹小脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 153020,
      "end_ms": 156775,
      "text": "这是当时几乎所有女孩都逃不开的宿命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 157390,
      "end_ms": 159600,
      "text": "可徐广平拼死反抗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 159680,
      "end_ms": 160305,
      "text": "哭闹着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 160640,
      "end_ms": 161945,
      "text": "死活不肯缠足。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 162560,
      "end_ms": 164895,
      "text": "幸好父亲思想相对开明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 165360,
      "end_ms": 166695,
      "text": "最终松了口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 167020,
      "end_ms": 169005,
      "text": "他才保住了一双自由的脚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 169780,
      "end_ms": 170815,
      "text": "后来他常说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 171280,
      "end_ms": 175600,
      "text": "自己这双脚是从旧礼教手里硬生生抢回来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 176290,
      "end_ms": 177715,
      "text": "在读书这件事上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 178050,
      "end_ms": 179675,
      "text": "他更是逆着规矩来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 180720,
      "end_ms": 185040,
      "text": "清末的广东依旧信奉女子无才便是德。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 185800,
      "end_ms": 187320,
      "text": "女孩家能识几个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 187660,
      "end_ms": 189700,
      "text": "写封家书就足够了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 190060,
      "end_ms": 196580,
      "text": "可徐广平偏要和家中兄弟一起进私塾、读书、学官画读典籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 196780,
      "end_ms": 198860,
      "text": "还偷偷找新式书报来看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 199700,
      "end_ms": 203400,
      "text": "早早接触到了民主与解放的新思想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 204080,
      "end_ms": 206520,
      "text": "在守旧沉闷的大家族里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 206680,
      "end_ms": 209960,
      "text": "他的一举一动都算得上离京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 209960,
      "end_ms": 212350,
      "text": "叛到一九一七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 212610,
      "end_ms": 213610,
      "text": "父亲病逝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 214130,
      "end_ms": 215350,
      "text": "马家没了顾忌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 215610,
      "end_ms": 217570,
      "text": "立刻上门步步紧逼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 217610,
      "end_ms": 218050,
      "text": "催婚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 218810,
      "end_ms": 220730,
      "text": "失去父亲庇护的徐广平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 221070,
      "end_ms": 222530,
      "text": "没有半分退缩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 222970,
      "end_ms": 225770,
      "text": "他在二哥的帮助下据理力争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 226330,
      "end_ms": 228810,
      "text": "最终彻底解除了这桩束缚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 228810,
      "end_ms": 230790,
      "text": "他近二十年的包办婚约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 231330,
      "end_ms": 233070,
      "text": "挣脱了婚姻的枷锁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 233490,
      "end_ms": 234850,
      "text": "他做了一个震惊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 234870,
      "end_ms": 235870,
      "text": "全家的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 235950,
      "end_ms": 238210,
      "text": "离开广东北上求学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 238450,
      "end_ms": 240245,
      "text": "去看更广阔的世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 241150,
      "end_ms": 245660,
      "text": "他先是考入天津直隶第一女子师范学校苦读。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 245660,
      "end_ms": 246315,
      "text": "多年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 246620,
      "end_ms": 250025,
      "text": "又顺利考入北京女子高等师范学校。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 250460,
      "end_ms": 252005,
      "text": "五四运动爆发时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 252340,
      "end_ms": 255285,
      "text": "他已经是学生运动的骨干领袖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 255630,
      "end_ms": 257855,
      "text": "上节演讲、创办刊物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 258260,
      "end_ms": 260485,
      "text": "还担任了刑事周刊的主编，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 261100,
      "end_ms": 262180,
      "text": "提笔写文章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 262200,
      "end_ms": 264655,
      "text": "呼吁妇女解放思想自由。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 265120,
      "end_ms": 267485,
      "text": "他从来不是躲在后面喊口号的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 267990,
      "end_ms": 270395,
      "text": "每次学生运动都冲在最前面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 270650,
      "end_ms": 271605,
      "text": "一九二五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 272260,
      "end_ms": 276515,
      "text": "北京女高师爆发轰动一时的屈阳风潮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 277410,
      "end_ms": 279590,
      "text": "校长杨殷于智孝装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 279590,
      "end_ms": 285295,
      "text": "横肆意压制学生思想激起的全校学生的反抗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 285780,
      "end_ms": 291655,
      "text": "身为学生会总干事的徐广平和后来在三幺八惨案中牺牲的刘和珍一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 292110,
      "end_ms": 298005,
      "text": "带领同学们罢课请愿、发檄文和校方强硬对抗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 298470,
      "end_ms": 300495,
      "text": "哪怕最终被学校开除，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 300950,
      "end_ms": 302585,
      "text": "他也始终挺直腰杆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 303030,
      "end_ms": 304330,
      "text": "没有半分低头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 305290,
      "end_ms": 307570,
      "text": "也正是在这段风波里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 307630,
      "end_ms": 309850,
      "text": "他提笔给鲁迅写了第一封信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 310410,
      "end_ms": 311990,
      "text": "开启了两人的缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 312830,
      "end_ms": 316190,
      "text": "很多人觉得徐广平是崇拜鲁迅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 316730,
      "end_ms": 318210,
      "text": "疑附鲁迅的小女生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 318990,
      "end_ms": 320570,
      "text": "可回头看他走过的路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 320570,
      "end_ms": 321330,
      "text": "就会明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 321810,
      "end_ms": 323130,
      "text": "在遇见鲁迅之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 323510,
      "end_ms": 331950,
      "text": "他早就已经是一个有思想、有胆识、敢和整个旧世界对抗的独立女性了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 331950,
      "end_ms": 334400,
      "text": "她有自己的理想和战场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 334720,
      "end_ms": 337760,
      "text": "有不输给任何人的勇气和棱角。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 338360,
      "end_ms": 340160,
      "text": "他敢于爱上鲁迅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 340400,
      "end_ms": 342360,
      "text": "敢于冲破世俗偏见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 342660,
      "end_ms": 343680,
      "text": "和他走到一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 343800,
      "end_ms": 345960,
      "text": "从来不是仰望式的义附，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 346120,
      "end_ms": 349240,
      "text": "而是两个独立灵魂的惺惺相惜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 350160,
      "end_ms": 352900,
      "text": "从被定下娃娃亲的世家小姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00126",
      "start_ms": 353240,
      "end_ms": 356300,
      "text": "到投身时代浪潮的新女性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00127",
      "start_ms": 356700,
      "end_ms": 359660,
      "text": "从挣脱封建礼教的叛逆者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00128",
      "start_ms": 360120,
      "end_ms": 362595,
      "text": "到守护鲁迅精神的践行者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00129",
      "start_ms": 362950,
      "end_ms": 364075,
      "text": "徐广平的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00130",
      "start_ms": 364500,
      "end_ms": 366335,
      "text": "从来都在为自己而活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00131",
      "start_ms": 366810,
      "end_ms": 368865,
      "text": "他不依附谁的光环，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00132",
      "start_ms": 369340,
      "end_ms": 371175,
      "text": "不被谁的标签定义。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00133",
      "start_ms": 371860,
      "end_ms": 375295,
      "text": "他就是他自己是敢和命运叫板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00134",
      "start_ms": 375650,
      "end_ms": 377625,
      "text": "敢为自己掌舵的徐广平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00135",
      "start_ms": 378220,
      "end_ms": 378610,
      "text": "好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00136",
      "start_ms": 378720,
      "end_ms": 379955,
      "text": "今天的故事就到这里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00137",
      "start_ms": 380140,
      "end_ms": 382275,
      "text": "你印象里的徐广平是什么样的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00138",
      "start_ms": 383080,
      "end_ms": 384465,
      "text": "欢迎在评论区留言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00139",
      "start_ms": 384690,
      "end_ms": 385595,
      "text": "聊聊你的看法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00140",
      "start_ms": 386510,
      "end_ms": 388675,
      "text": "如果喜欢这样的传奇女性故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00141",
      "start_ms": 388910,
      "end_ms": 390105,
      "text": "别忘了点赞关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0ac04558a0b201d0_s00142",
      "start_ms": 390410,
      "end_ms": 394965,
      "text": "下期继续带你解锁更多被历史低估的独立人生。"
    }
  ],
